entries.def:
εἰ, 
conjunctive particle, used in conditions and in indirect questions. 
__I. Conditional, if; 
__1. with indic, expressing a general assumption; 
__(a) pres.: before indic, pres., Mat.11.14, Rom.8.25, al.; before imperat., Mrk.4.23; 9.22, Jhn.15.18, 1Co.7.9, al.; before fut. indic., Luk.16.31, Rom.8.11, al.; before pf. or aor., with negation in apodosis, Mat.12.26, Rom.4.14, al.; similarly, before impf., Luk.17.6,…
